/-!
# Project completion target

The primary target is an auditable classification of every ordered implication between distinct
positive properties in the π-Base catalogue. Negated literals and multi-premise statements belong
to the separate implication-checker workflow and are not part of this finite target.
-/

@[expose] public section

universe u

namespace PiBase.Formal

/-- A bundled property together with its stable positive numeric π-Base identifier. -/
structure PiBasePropertyEntry where
  /-- The stable π-Base identifier, such as `1` for `P1`. -/
  id : Nat
  /-- The bundled Lean property represented by this identifier. -/
